' purpose: Selected Rust workspace with direct Burn scoring and a retained standalone protocol test surface.
' covers: Cargo.toml
' covers: rust-toolchain.toml
' covers: packages/training/Cargo.toml
' covers: packages/training/src/lib.rs
' covers: packages/training/src/main.rs
' covers: packages/training/src/model.rs
' covers: packages/training/src/protocol.rs
' covers: packages/training/tests/protocol.rs
' covers: tooling/xtask/src/main.rs
' covers: tooling/xtask/src/lib.rs
' covers: tooling/xtask/src/runner.rs
' covers: tooling/xtask/src/identity.rs
' covers: tooling/xtask/src/invoices.rs
' covers: tooling/xtask/src/preservation.rs
' status: Synthetic source contract; matching-source verification and review status live in the plan.
' related: _spec/_plans/burn-flex-compat.md
' related: _spec/ml/rebuild-runtime-research.md
