@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Direct Rust Burn compatibility — synthetic source contract
left to right direction

component "apps/arena/src/lib.rs\nRust policy caller" as ARENA <<app>>
package "Root Cargo workspace\nCargo.toml / one reused Cargo.lock" {
  component "packages/training/src/lib.rs\ntraining_native::score_synthetic_f64" as LIB <<app>>
  component "packages/training/src/model.rs\nsynthetic-linear-418-v1\nw=[0.5,-0.25,0,...] / b=0.125" as MODEL <<app>>
  component "packages/training/src/main.rs\ntraining-native standalone binary" as CLI <<host>>
  component "packages/training/src/protocol.rs\ntraining-burn-compat-v1\nuint32 id / score only" as PROTOCOL <<app>>
  component "tooling/xtask/src/main.rs\nRust verifier / cargo xtask check\nfrozen workspace inventory" as XTASK <<host>>
}
component "Burn 0.22.0 / Rust 1.95.0\nFlex CPU / explicit f64\nstd + flex + optim + store" as BURN <<cloud>>
component "Rust unit tests\npackages/training/tests/protocol.rs\nsynthetic compatibility fixtures" as PROOF <<app>>
database "Temporary Burnpack fixture\nexact parameter-bit restoration\ncorrupt data rejected" as PACK <<db>>
component "Closed failure\nno backend or precision fallback\nfailed gate keeps reviews forbidden" as FAILURE <<error>>

ARENA ARROW_MAIN LIB : direct typed Rust call\nno scoring child / no Bun bridge
LIB ARROW_MAIN MODEL : validate 1..512 rows x 418\nfinite values / abs(value) <= 1e6
MODEL ARROW_MAIN BURN : local f64 tensor operations\nRust implementation / no runtime network
CLI ARROW_MAIN PROTOCOL : retained standalone test surface\none JSON request / stdin EOF / <= 8 MiB
PROTOCOL ARROW_MAIN LIB : same fixed scoring model\nno model/checkpoint path input
PROTOCOL ARROW_MAIN CLI : one JSON response + newline\nmatching id / finite ordered scores
XTASK ARROW_OPTIONAL PROOF : fresh workspace tests\nactual counts and unchanged-input receipt
PROOF ARROW_OPTIONAL MODEL : fixed analytic fixtures\nlr=0.125 / one synthetic SGD step
PROOF ARROW_OPTIONAL BURN : actual autodiff + optimizer\nno hand-coded substitute
PROOF ARROW_OPTIONAL PACK : real Burnpack save / restore
PROTOCOL ARROW_ERROR FAILURE : invalid framing / version / id\ninvalid shape / excess bytes
LIB ARROW_ERROR FAILURE : invalid numeric input\nno JS or f32 fallback
XTASK ARROW_ERROR FAILURE : any required gate fails\nno old receipt reuse

note bottom of LIB
  The arena calls the Rust library directly,
  so scoring needs no second child process.
  The retained binary tests its wire protocol
  without bringing back the retired JavaScript
  host or its runtime dependencies.
end note

note bottom of MODEL
  Set the dtype before creating tensors, because
  widening rounded values cannot restore lost
  bits. Zero padding gives the proof its fixed
  input shape without implementing the economic
  feature encoder.
end note

note bottom of PACK
  Use Burnpack for checkpoint fixtures so JSON
  cannot substitute for the backend serializer.
  Restoring must preserve each parameter bit
  and reject corrupt data without admitting a
  learned model.
end note

note bottom of XTASK
  The previous receipt covers different source
  paths and runtime boundaries, so it cannot
  authorize reviews of this migration. Fresh
  workspace checks must bind every required
  result to the same unchanged input.
end note

legend bottom
  Source contract; see the plan for matched-source receipts.
  Synthetic optimization tests only; no real training.
  Width 418 is padding, not the R4 feature encoder.
  modelArtifact=null; no admission or activation.
  Only a complete fresh gate unlocks reviewers.
endlegend
@enduml
